SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- LV Lititz Chocolate Ride (23R) C/D Pace-- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rot
 ating start location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- 
 mile routes\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” s
 top for refreshment/coffee mid-route at [New Holland Coffee](https://www.n
 ewhollandcoffee.com/) (Lititz location) or one of the other Lititz coffee 
 shops\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a single pace.\n
 As Sweep\, Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe CoffeeTue r
 ides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group
 . Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned stop to reg
 roup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid a
 nyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n**Be 
 Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](https:/
 /routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-lititz-chocolate-ride-23r/)\n\nHelmet
 s are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (s
 pare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing arou
 nd a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP
  below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club 
 member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id
 =60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's
  [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_
 id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lan
 cbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id
 =325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=4
 54318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.a
 mazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_
 123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&respo
 nse-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&
 Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3146941
 18/
