SUMMARY:Impromptu: LV Off the Beaten Goatpath (23R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is a "fun" ride no o
 ne will be left behind. Re-grouping stops as needed.\n\nRide leader: Jon H
 artung\nSweep: Ann Morris\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRoute:
  [LV Off the Beaten Goatpath (23R) - Lancaster Bike Club](https://routes.l
 ancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-off-the-beaten-goatpath-23r/)\n\nThe ride lead
 er will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a gro
 up ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/
 her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and a swee
 per may also be appointed at the start. Please do not join this ride if yo
 u are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, 
 you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group.\n\nI
 f maintaining a 11-12 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, p
 lease consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wai
 ver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ri
 de. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancast
 erbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the
  club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct Guidance if an incident occurs: I
 ncident Actions
